---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: "The Clay Journal — Made Out of Clay Productions"
description: "Warm, gentle reads for families: faith, big feelings, neurodivergent kids, cozy family life, and the picture books that help."
breadcrumbs:
  - { name: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { name: "Blog", url: "/blog/" }
---
<section class="page-head journal-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--clay);margin-bottom:10px">The Clay Journal</p>
    <h1>Little reads, big hearts.</h1>
    <p>Two-minute reads for the grown-ups shaping little ones &mdash; faith &amp; family, big feelings, neurodivergent kids, and the cozy stuff of family life.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    {% set featured = collections.posts[0] %}
    <article class="journal-feature">
      <img src="{{ featured.data.ogImage or ('/assets/og/posts/' + featured.fileSlug + '.png') }}" alt="" width="1200" height="630">
      <div>
        <span class="jtag">Featured</span>
        <h2><a href="{{ featured.url }}">{{ featured.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ featured.data.description }}</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ featured.url }}">Read the featured story</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <div class="journal-filters" aria-labelledby="journal-filter-title">
      <h2 id="journal-filter-title">Browse by topic</h2>
      <label>Topic
        <select id="journal-topic">
          <option value="all">All topics</option>
          <option value="neurodivergent-kids">Neurodivergent kids</option>
          <option value="big-feelings">Big feelings</option>
          <option value="faith-family">Faith and family</option>
          <option value="family-life">Family life</option>
          <option value="bedtime-calm">Bedtime and calm</option>
          <option value="read-alouds">Read-alouds</option>
        </select>
      </label>
    </div>
    <div class="journal-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}{% if not loop.first %}
      <a class="journal-tile" href="{{ post.url }}" data-topic="{{ post.data.tag | slugify }}">
        <img class="journal-tile-image" src="{{ post.data.ogImage or ('/assets/og/posts/' + post.fileSlug + '.png') }}" alt="" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        {% if post.data.tag %}<span class="jtag jtag-{{ post.data.tag | slugify }}">{{ post.data.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <div class="jfoot">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <span class="jread">Read &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p id="journal-empty" hidden>No articles match that topic yet.</p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="prose">First posts coming soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section journal-follow">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:640px;text-align:center">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px">Follow the Journal &#128155;</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:18px">One gentle read at a time &mdash; new posts, new books, and free printables in your inbox. No noise, just the good stuff.</p>
    {% set signupLocation = "journal" %}
    {% include "partials/newsletter.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
